6,Acts,6. IMPULSE PROCEDURE
6A,6,6A. MOVEMENT SEGMENT
6A4,6A,6A4: FINAL MOVEMENT ACTIONS STAGE
6A4.02,6A4,Announce speed changes and change web passage status.
6B,6,6B. IMPULSE ACTIVITY SEGMENT
6B01,6B,6B1: INITIAL STAGE
6B01.02,6B01,Change fire control status
6B02,6B,6B02: CLOAKING DEVICE STAGE
6B02.01,6B02,Activate/deactivate cloaking device.
6B03,6B,6B03: LOCKON STAGE
6B03.01,6B03,Roll for lockon.
6B04,6B,6B04: SHIP SYSTEM FUNCTIONS STAGE
6B04.03a,6B04,Activate/deactivate SubSpace Fields.
6B04.03b,6B04,Launch Mass Driver Missiles
6B04.04,6B04,Operate Tractors
6B04.06,6B04,Attempt to identify seeking weapons.
6B06,6B,6B06: SEEKING WEAPONS STAGE
6B06.01,6B06,Release control of seeking weapons.
6B06.03,6B06,Launch plasma torpedoes.
6B06.04,6B06,MW Release Step: Deploy drones from SP shuttles.
6B06.05,6B06,Launch drones.
6B06.08,6B06,ESG Step: De-activate/activate ESGs.
6B07,6B,6B07: MARINES ACTIVITY STAGE
6B07.02,6B07,Operate Shields Step: Drop/raise shields.
6B07.03,6B07,Operate transporters
6B08,6B,6B08: SHUTTLE & PF FUNCTIONS STAGE
6B08.01,6B08,Challenge enemy shuttles to a dogfight (J7.0).
6B08.03,6B08,Recover/land shuttlecraft/fighters.
6B08.05,6B08,Launch shuttlecraft/fighters
6B10,6B,6B10: SEPARATIONS STAGE
6B10.03,6B10,Lay mines
6B11,6B,6B11: FINAL FUNCTIONS STAGE
6B11.02,6B11,Activate/deactive Flame Shields & Flame Shield Projectors
6B11.03,6B11,Announce emergency deceleration.
6B11.04,6B11,Activate Plasma Cloud Generators and Sub Space Coagulators
6C,6,6C.DOGFIGHT RESOLUTION INTERFACE
6C03,6C,Announce intent to separate by breakoff dogfight
6C04,6C,Determine dogfight advantage
6C06,6C,Drop chaff.
6C07,6C,Fire dogfighting fighter weapons at drones launched.
6C09,6C,Determine if drones hit dogfightting fighter.
6D1.01,6,DisDev Declaration Step: Announce displacement device
6D1.02,6,Fire Decision Step
